Generic single-database configuration with an async dbapi.

## Commands

### To migrate
```console
user~$ alembic upgrade head
```

### To migrate to custom database
```console
user~$ alembic -x dbname=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/database upgrade head
```

### To autogenerate migration
```console
user~$ python punk/migrations/autogenerate.py -m your_revision_message
```
